{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45434","headline":"酬卢仝见访不遇题壁 · 含曦","name":"酬卢仝见访不遇题壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长寿寺石壁，卢公一首诗。\n渴读即不渴，饥读即不饥。\n鲸吞海水尽，露出珊瑚枝。\n海神知贵不知价，留向人间光照夜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"含曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}